      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Our Friend Fr. Gabriel drove down from Notre Dame Today and had quite a nice little visit with us. He was telling of you not being too well recently. I surely sympathise with you and hope your re- covery may come speedily, God willing - God Willing. .... It would a great thing for you if you and your Brothers could, a little trip to the scenes of Quebec, Mont Royal, etc. ... I surely would enjoy going. .... Please let us hear from you. ... Keep well ...",
